      "solution": "public class Main {\n    public static int merge(int[] values, int[] next, int ha, int hb) {\n        int head = -1, tail = -1;\n        while (ha != -1 && hb != -1) {\n            int pick;\n            if (values[ha] <= values[hb]) { pick = ha; ha = next[ha]; }\n            else { pick = hb; hb = next[hb]; }\n            if (head == -1) head = pick; else next[tail] = pick;\n            tail = pick;\n        }\n        int rest = (ha != -1) ? ha : hb;\n        if (head == -1) return rest;\n        next[tail] = rest;\n        return head;\n    }\n}\n",
